entityDescription:
Bluetensor is a customer focused and technology-driven company specialized in providing artificial intelligence (AI) technology and solutions to grow the business of companies. Main technologies developed by Bluetensor are:
Computer Vision systems, for objects recognition in images or videos;
Natural Language Processing, for extract information from textual content or support for text generation;
Predictive analysis, in order to generate predictive models to support decisions.
Bluetensor has collaborations with important companies which operate in various sectors including industry, insurance, banking, services, etc.
Artificial Intelligence projects play a strategic role in the competitiveness of companies, so many customers ask for confidentiality. Among the most prestigious is the WHO (World Health Organization) which has chosen Bluetensor technology for the implementation of a Reasoning System.
